{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/946850-the-god-machine-and-the-principle","id":946850,"title":"The God-Machine and the Principle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-09T04:08:58-07:00","id":946850,"title":"The God-Machine and the Principle","content":"I heard there is a sidebar in Promethean 2nd ed dealing with the relationship between the God-Machine and the Principle. Could someone please summarize it for me? I'd really appreciate it.<br /> <br /> As I understand it, the Principle is the ultimate source of Pyros, the Divine Fire that empowers Prometheans. My personal headcanon has always been that the qashmallim and the angels of the God-Machine often compete over worshippers and occult resources. I'm curious to see how this compares to the canon explanation. Thanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T05:54:18-07:00","id":946895,"title":"","content":"The section offers multiple speculations of the Prometheans on what the God-Machine is.<br /> <br /> 1. They're not related and don't interfere with each other.<br /> 2.The Principle is an older version of the G-M that is still managing to hold on.<br /> 3.The Principle and and GM are two opposing entities, the former embodying fire and change, the latter cold and stasis.<br /> 4.The Principle has been pushed out of the world by the GM.<br /> <br /> Bear in mind, Prometheans don't actually know what the Principle is either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T06:05:41-07:00","id":946900,"title":"","content":"I'm still sticking with the idea that the Principle is the God-Machine's Genitor, and they are both part of a Lineage of Created divinities. The God-Machine's inscrutable and often conflicting objectives are the results of its shifting Refinements and Roles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 08-09-2016, 09:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T09:01:45-07:00","id":946980,"title":"","content":"Thank you, Michael. I think I'm going with explanation three (fire and change versus cold and stasis) if I run a Promethean game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T09:38:33-07:00","id":947017,"title":"","content":"It's also noted in the book that qashmallim and GM angels don't really interact or even seem aware of each other unless someone or something forces it; they normally operate on completely different frequencies of Twilight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T10:30:14-07:00","id":947062,"title":"","content":"My initial speculation was that the GM came first, and the Principle was a sort of &quot;glitched&quot; subsection of it that acted in ways counter to the Machine's overall objectives.<br /> <br /> I always thought that the Pilgrimage was ultimately serving the machine, though. It makes the Promethean who succeeds in it much more stable, safe, and easier to control, which is what the Machine wants. I'm not sure why there's so much speculation that the two would necessarily be opposed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T12:53:10-07:00","id":947173,"title":"","content":"My pet theory is that The Principle takes the role of the Gnostic true divinity, with the God-Machine as the flawed demiurge of the material world; it's why the Principle deals with incredible Pyros where the Machine can only manipulate base Essence, and the Principle can (indirectly, via Prometheans) create new souls while the Machine can only make Covers. Both have angels, but one is an imperfect copy of the other.<br /> <br /> Things get real screwy when you consider the nature of souls in the wider CofD setting and why humans are the only creatures that can Awaken (possibly tying into the Empyrean), but that's neither here nor there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T13:14:12-07:00","id":947189,"title":"","content":"I like to think that they're two halves of a sundered entity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T13:29:46-07:00","id":947199,"title":"","content":"My own take is generally that the God Machine is essentially an attempt by The Principle to not just inspire creation but to enact its own. We create life in our image, and The Principle is no different. Rather than flesh or metal it made an opus out of the world itself, interlocking systems of concepts and ideas strung together until they self sustain and take on the appearance of life. It is incomplete though, a half thing that is neither worldly nor divine. What it seeks is its own completion, entailing projecting its influence and infrastructure forward and backward through time from the moment of its birth until it is has made itself inseparable from our universe, integrated into its every facet and transcended the sum of its infinite parts. Thus complete it will confront and overthrow its creator, making it free at last to act on its own imperative and reorder the world according to whatever wish it may have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T11:05:19-07:00","id":949426,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/946850-the-god-machine-and-the-principle?p=947199#post947199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My own take is generally that the God Machine is essentially an attempt by The Principle to not just inspire creation but to enact its own. We create life in our image, and The Principle is no different. Rather than flesh or metal it made an opus out of the world itself, interlocking systems of concepts and ideas strung together until they self sustain and take on the appearance of life. It is incomplete though, a half thing that is neither worldly nor divine. What it seeks is its own completion, entailing projecting its influence and infrastructure forward and backward through time from the moment of its birth until it is has made itself inseparable from our universe, integrated into its every facet and transcended the sum of its infinite parts. Thus complete it will confront and overthrow its creator, making it free at last to act on its own imperative and reorder the world according to whatever wish it may have.</div> </div> </div> </div>One could almost call such an Act of creation Generative, could they not? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 08-12-2016, 02:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T22:49:33-07:00","id":949864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/946850-the-god-machine-and-the-principle?p=949426#post949426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> One could almost call such an Act of creation Generative, could they not? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well gosh, I suppose they could now that I think about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T23:50:30-07:00","id":949897,"title":"","content":"My own conception of how Prometheans interact with the God Machine goes thusly: The God Machine knows the serial number of every soul in creation. Not just the ones that are currently alive, but those waiting to be born, those that have passed on, and those that will repeat the cycle. The number of souls is fixed, there will only be as many as there ever were and ever will be. It's like the conservation of matter; souls can neither be created nor destroyed, they simply change form and travel and shift phases The God Machine knows this to be true, and therefore it is an immutable fact. Everything is in its proper place, every interaction predicted and accounted for in the grand operation. Prometheans... are a problem. They are not made with souls and therefore are uncataloged by the Machine. As invisible variables they interact with individuals in ways that were unable to be foreseen, each conversation or passing glance nudging someone out their prescribed lane. If a Promethean achieves the New Dawn then something truly remarkable has happened; a new soul where none existed before. This is impossible, this violates an unyielding law of the universe, yet it happens just the same. To the God Machine this isn't just chaos, this is <i>anarchy</i>. Merely by existing Prometheans are a wrench in the God Machine's gears, the Pilgrimage a determined rebellion against the &quot;way it should be.&quot; By achieving the New Dawn, they threaten to compromise its entire design.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-12T23:54:47-07:00","id":949900,"title":"","content":"A lot of these ideas are interesting, but I was deliberately trying to shake up the &quot;The God-Machine must be against the Pilgrimage because Pilgrimage = Good and God-Machine = Bad!&quot; assumption.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5358-geckopirateship","name":"Geckopirateship","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5358_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1383"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T08:08:16-07:00","id":950035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Caitiff Primogen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/946850-the-god-machine-and-the-principle?p=949897#post949897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My own conception of how Prometheans interact with the God Machine goes thusly: The God Machine knows the serial number of every soul in creation. Not just the ones that are currently alive, but those waiting to be born, those that have passed on, and those that will repeat the cycle. The number of souls is fixed, there will only be as many as there ever were and ever will be. It's like the conservation of matter; souls can neither be created nor destroyed, they simply change form and travel and shift phases The God Machine knows this to be true, and therefore it is an immutable fact. Everything is in its proper place, every interaction predicted and accounted for in the grand operation. Prometheans... are a problem. They are not made with souls and therefore are uncataloged by the Machine. As invisible variables they interact with individuals in ways that were unable to be foreseen, each conversation or passing glance nudging someone out their prescribed lane. If a Promethean achieves the New Dawn then something truly remarkable has happened; a new soul where none existed before. This is impossible, this violates an unyielding law of the universe, yet it happens just the same. To the God Machine this isn't just chaos, this is <i>anarchy</i>. Merely by existing Prometheans are a wrench in the God Machine's gears, the Pilgrimage a determined rebellion against the &amp;quot;way it should be.&amp;quot; By achieving the New Dawn, they threaten to compromise its entire design.</div> </div> </div> </div>How do you reconcile a fixed number of souls with the fact that the human population is ever-expanding? Do a significant number of humans not have souls, or have most souls been in storage for millennia?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T09:23:47-07:00","id":950084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/946850-the-god-machine-and-the-principle?p=950035#post950035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> How do you reconcile a fixed number of souls with the fact that the human population is ever-expanding? Do a significant number of humans not have souls, or have most souls been in storage for millennia?</div> </div> </div> </div>The latter. There are many souls that have yet to be born, as well as many souls which reincarnate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}